We have uploaded a revised version of the paper with all modifications discussed in the reviews.

The most significant changes are:
* adding new examples in Sections 2 and 3, in particular a figure showing the encoding (and decoding) of a dataset into a coloured graph;
* adding a new appendix describing the rule extraction algorithm that we use in Section 4;
* adding all requested details about the experimental evaluation in Section 4; and 
* adding all suggested references to the Related Work section.
